#
# Response headers for every static asset of numinia.org. Cloudflare Workers
# static assets read this file from the assets directory (dist/, copied from
# public/ by the build) and do not serve it. Audit of 2 October 2026 (PRO-034):
# numinia.org sent none of these; numinia.com already did.
#
# The policy is what the built site needs, measured on the build:
#   'unsafe-inline' (script, style) — Astro inlines its small page scripts
#     and the theme bootstrap; components carry style="" attributes.
#   'wasm-unsafe-eval' — Pagefind's search index runs as WebAssembly.
#     It is not 'unsafe-eval': no string is evaluated as code.
#   img-src data: blob: — an SVG in the stylesheet; Open books builds its
#     downloads in the browser.
#   connect-src / worker-src 'self' — Pagefind fetches its index and starts
#     its worker from /pagefind/; the copy button fetches the page's .md.
# Nothing loads from another host. Add a source here only with the change
# that needs it, and say which.
#
# frame-ancestors (2026-10-18, t_98c49144): the engine's world screens embed
# numinia.org (and /missions/) in an iframe, read from numinia.com /
# *.numinia.com. frame-ancestors names exactly those two hosts; every other
# site stays refused. X-Frame-Options stays DENY for browsers too old to
# read CSP frame-ancestors — per the Fetch spec, a frame-ancestors directive
# overrides X-Frame-Options wherever both are understood, so numinia.com's
# iframe still renders in current browsers.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' 'wasm-unsafe-eval'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob:; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self'; worker-src 'self'; media-src 'self'; frame-ancestors 'self' https://numinia.com https://*.numinia.com; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; object-src 'none'
